      "title": "Investor sentiment improves as stock rises 17%",
      "body": "After last week's 17% share price gain to ₹2,867, the stock trades at a trailing P/E ratio of 69.7x. Average trailing P/E is 22x in the IT industry in India. Total returns to shareholders of 554% over the past three years.",
